  30          /*******************************************************************************
  31          * Function Name: FRAC_CLK_Start
  32          ********************************************************************************
  33          *
  34          * Summary:
  35          *  Starts the clock. Note that on startup, clocks may be already running if the
  36          *  "Start on Reset" option is enabled in the DWR.
  37          *
  38          * Parameters:
  39          *  None
  40          *
  41          * Returns:
  42          *  None
  43          *
  44          *******************************************************************************/
