 170          /*******************************************************************************
 171          * Function Name: FRAC_CLK_SetDividerRegister
 172          ********************************************************************************
 173          *
 174          * Summary:
 175          *  Modifies the clock divider and, thus, the frequency. When the clock divider
 176          *  register is set to zero or changed from zero, the clock will be temporarily
